flowchart TD
  Start[Automatic v4 session] --> Local[Local analysis and deterministic design]
  Local --> Arrangement[Constrained arrangement decision]
  Arrangement -->|valid authoritative plan| Compile[Compile and execute]
  Arrangement -->|invalid or no permitted correction| Manual[manual_review_required]
  Compile --> Technical{Technical gate passes?}
  Technical -->|no| Correct[Targeted permitted correction]
  Technical -->|yes| Musical{Musical review approves?}
  Musical -->|no| Correct
  Musical -->|yes| Promote[Promote selected candidate]
  Correct -->|limit reached| Manual
  Correct -->|allowed| Compile
